<title>CHILE: Chile's Concha y Toro H1 net climbs.</title>
<headline>Chile's Concha y Toro H1 net climbs.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean winery Vina Concha y Toro SA reported the following results in the first half of the year.</p>
<p>				 H1 1997	   H1 1996</p>
<p>Net earnings		    3.87		2.88</p>
<p>Operating profit		4.21		3.13</p>
<p>Non-operating profit	  0.14		0.01</p>
<p>Total sales		    23.37	     19.30</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>((--Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
